  "emailBody": "\n        <html>\n\n        <body\n            style=\"\n                font-family:Segoe UI, Arial, sans-serif;\n                margin:20px;\n            \"\n        >\n\n            <div\n                style=\"\n                    background:#d42e12;\n                    color:white;\n                    padding:15px;\n                    border-radius:8px;\n                \"\n            >\n\n\n               <h1 style=\"margin:0;\">\n                    Fuel Market Intelligence Morning Report\n                </h1>\n\n                <p style=\"margin:5px 0 0 0;\">\n                    30 July 2026\n                </p>\n\n            </div>\n\n            <p\n                style=\"\n                    font-size:16px;\n                    margin-top:20px;\n                    margin-bottom:20px;\n                \"\n            >\n                Good morning Sir,\n                <br><br>\n                \n                Here is today's fuel market intelligence report highlighting\n                the latest PMS and AGO depot prices together with key industry\n                developments and market news.\n            </p>\n\n            <br>\n\n            \n        <h2 style=\"color:#d42e12;\">\n            PMS Prices\n        </h2>\n\n        <div\n            style=\"\n                background:#fad5a1;\n                padding:12px;\n                border-left:5px solid #f28e05;\n                margin-bottom:10px;\n                font-size:16px;\n                font-weight:bold;\n            \"\n        >\n            Average PMS Prices: ₦1,222.88/L\n        </div>\n\n        <table\n            width=\"100%\"\n            cellspacing=\"0\"\n            cellpadding=\"10\"\n            style=\"\n                border-collapse:collapse;\n                border:1px solid #ddd;\n            \"\n        >\n\n            <tr style=\"background:#d42e12;color:white;\">\n                <th align=\"left\">Depot</th>\n                <th align=\"left\">Price</th>\n            </tr>\n\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td>EMADEB</td>\n                <td>₦1,217.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td>SOBAZ</td>\n                <td>₦1,225.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td>MAINLAND</td>\n                <td>₦1,225.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td>MATRIX WARRI</td>\n                <td>₦1,233.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td>OPTIMA</td>\n                <td>₦1,230.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td>DANGOTE</td>\n                <td>₦1,215.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td>HEYDEN</td>\n                <td>₦1,220.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td>ARDOVA</td>\n                <td>₦1,218.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n\n        </table>\n\n        <br>\n        \n\n            \n        <h2 style=\"color:#d42e12;\">\n            AGO Prices\n        </h2>\n\n        <div\n            style=\"\n                background:#fad5a1;\n                padding:12px;\n                border-left:5px solid #f28e05;\n                margin-bottom:10px;\n                font-size:16px;\n                font-weight:bold;\n            \"\n        >\n            Average AGO Prices: ₦1,652.50/L\n        </div>\n\n        <table\n            width=\"100%\"\n            cellspacing=\"0\"\n            cellpadding=\"10\"\n            style=\"\n                border-collapse:collapse;\n                border:1px solid #ddd;\n            \"\n        >\n\n            <tr style=\"background:#d42e12;color:white;\">\n                <th align=\"left\">Depot</th>\n                <th align=\"left\">Price</th>\n            </tr>\n\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td>TMDK</td>\n                <td>₦1,650.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td>MENJ</td>\n                <td>₦1,650.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td>AITEO</td>\n                <td>₦1,650.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td>NIPCO WARRI</td>\n                <td>₦1,650.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td>ZAMSON</td>\n                <td>₦1,670.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td>PRUDENT OGHARA</td>\n                <td>₦1,650.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td>WOSBAB</td>\n                <td>₦1,650.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td>GULF TREASURE</td>\n                <td>₦1,650.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n\n        </table>\n\n        <br>\n        \n\n            \n        <h2 style=\"color:#d42e12;\">\n            Market News\n        </h2>\n        \n            <div\n                style=\"\n                    border:1px solid #fad5a1;\n                    padding:15px;\n                    margin-bottom:15px;\n                    border-radius:8px;\n                    \n                \"\n            >\n\n                <h3>\n                    Building 700,000 bpd Refinery Was The Biggest Business Risk of My Life — Aliko Dangote\n                </h3>\n\n                <p>\n                    Aliko Dangote described the development of the 700,000-barrels-per-day refinery as the biggest business risk of his career. He said the successful delivery of the project demonstrates that Nigerian entrepreneurs can execute world-class industrial investments despite difficult operating conditions. He urged the Federal Government to sustain policies that support indigenous investors.\n                </p>\n\n                <a\n                    href=\"https://petroleumprice.ng/news/articles/building-700000-bpd-refinery-was-the-biggest-business-risk-of-my-life-aliko-dangote\"\n                    target=\"_blank\"\n                    style=\"\n                        color:#d42e12;\n                        font-weight:bold;\n                        text-decoration:none;\n                    \"\n                >\n                    Full Article →\n                </a>\n\n            </div>\n            \n            <div\n                style=\"\n                    border:1px solid #fad5a1;\n                    padding:15px;\n                    margin-bottom:15px;\n                    border-radius:8px;\n                    \n                \"\n            >\n\n                <h3>\n                    Dangote Refinery Files IPO Application, Targets September Stock Market Debut\n                </h3>\n\n                <p>\n                    Dangote Petroleum Refinery has formally applied to the Securities and Exchange Commission for an Initial Public Offering (IPO) The company targets a September 2026 debut on the Nigerian Exchange. The application marks a significant milestone in the refinery's transition from private ownership to a publicly listed company.\n                </p>\n\n                <a\n                    href=\"https://petroleumprice.ng/news/articles/dangote-refinery-files-ipo-application-targets-september-stock-market-debut\"\n                    target=\"_blank\"\n                    style=\"\n                        color:#d42e12;\n                        font-weight:bold;\n                        text-decoration:none;\n                    \"\n                >\n                    Full Article →\n                </a>\n\n            </div>\n            \n            <div\n                style=\"\n                    border:1px solid #fad5a1;\n                    padding:15px;\n                    margin-bottom:15px;\n                    border-radius:8px;\n                    \n                \"\n            >\n\n                <h3>\n                    Dangote Refinery Rolls Out Free Petrol Delivery in Six States at ₦1,215/Litre\n                </h3>\n\n                <p>\n                    The Dangote Petroleum Refinery has unveiled the first phase of its free petrol delivery programme. The initiative will initially cover Lagos, Ogun, Rivers, Kaduna, the Federal Capital Territory (Abuja), and Delta. Under the programme, Premium Motor Spirit (PMS) will continue to be supplied at the refinery's existing gantry price of ₦1,215 per litre.\n                </p>\n\n                <a\n                    href=\"https://petroleumprice.ng/news/articles/dangote-refinery-rolls-out-free-petrol-delivery-in-six-states-at-1215litre\"\n                    target=\"_blank\"\n                    style=\"\n                        color:#d42e12;\n                        font-weight:bold;\n                        text-decoration:none;\n                    \"\n                >\n                    Full Article →\n                </a>\n\n            </div>\n            \n            <div\n                style=\"\n                    border:1px solid #fad5a1;\n                    padding:15px;\n                    margin-bottom:15px;\n                    border-radius:8px;\n                    \n                \"\n            >\n\n                <h3>\n                    Diesel Depot Prices Rise as Brent Crude Surges to Nearly $90\n                </h3>\n\n                <p>\n                    Diesel depot prices have started climbing across major Nigerian supply hubs as Brent crude surged to nearly $90 per barrel. The rebound in crude prices followed renewed geopolitical tensions involving the United States, Saudi Arabia and Iran.\n                </p>\n\n                <a\n                    href=\"https://petroleumprice.ng/news/articles/diesel-depot-prices-rise-as-brent-crude-surges-to-nearly-90\"\n                    target=\"_blank\"\n                    style=\"\n                        color:#d42e12;\n                        font-weight:bold;\n                        text-decoration:none;\n                    \"\n                >\n                    Full Article →\n                </a>\n\n            </div>\n            \n            <div\n                style=\"\n                    border:1px solid #fad5a1;\n                    padding:15px;\n                    margin-bottom:15px;\n                    border-radius:8px;\n                    \n                \"\n            >\n\n                <h3>\n                    OPEC+ Set to End Monthly Output Hikes After September Increase\n                </h3>\n\n                <p>\n                    OPEC+ is expected to approve one final oil production increase for September before suspending its monthly output adjustments for the remainder of the year. The planned adjustment would mirror the production increases implemented in June, July and August. If adopted, the decision would leave an additional 2 million bpd of broader OPEC+ production cuts in place through the end of this year.\n                </p>\n\n                <a\n                    href=\"https://petroleumprice.ng/news/articles/opec-set-to-end-monthly-output-hikes-after-september-increase\"\n                    target=\"_blank\"\n                    style=\"\n                        color:#d42e12;\n                        font-weight:bold;\n                        text-decoration:none;\n                    \"\n                >\n                    Full Article →\n                </a>\n\n            </div>\n            \n\n        </body>\n\n        </html>\n        "
